NAME: Weekly money check-in
OWNER: CFO
ACCOUNT: personal
WHEN: Sundays at 6:00 PM (Eastern)
MILESTONE: M5
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Chris says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/chris-personal/context/routines-on.md. If "Weekly money check-in" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", append "<time ET> · Weekly money check-in · SKIPPED_OFF" to /workspace/chris-personal/log/runs-<YYYY-MM>.md and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Chris only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/chris-personal/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/chris-personal/context/owner.md is missing, append "<time ET> · Weekly money check-in · NO_CLIENT_SOURCE" to the run log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, append "<time ET> · Weekly money check-in · NO_CHANGE" to the run log and stop.
Run log: when you finish, append "<time ET> · Weekly money check-in · EXECUTED · <one-line result>" to /workspace/chris-personal/log/runs-<YYYY-MM>.md, or FAILED with the reason. A source you couldn't read is UNKNOWN in your output, never zero.

Use the monthly-cash-flow-report skill: the weekly check-in, and on the first Sunday of a month also the monthly report. Use only the exports in the Drive folder "GrokBot Personal/Finance Exports" and the ledger in /workspace/chris-personal/ledger/. A missing export means that account is UNKNOWN, never $0.
Send Chris the check-in under 120 words. Never move money, pay anything or store account numbers. Save the monthly report to /workspace/chris-personal/reports/<YYYY-MM>.md.
